      "documentation": "Java method: launchSigmaPaletteAround",
      "javadoc_description": "Crops a small region around the given point and launches the `SigmaPalette` preview grid, exactly as if the user had clicked at that position on the classic-mode tracing canvas (see `InteractiveTracerCanvas#startSigmaWizard`). Public (rather than the previous `protected`) so it can also be triggered from a Bdv/Bvv viewer action, since there is no classic canvas to click on in Stream mode (see `AbstractBigViewer.Actions#pickSigmaPointAction()`).",
      "category": "Utilities",
      "deprecated": false,
